{
  "info": {
    "name": "Corenio API — Carts/Orders Test Log v4 (2026-09-01, round 4)",
    "description": "Fourth test pass. Context: Dave's team deployed an int-cast fix for the shippingmethods bug, reported as 'still merging' at test time. Result: unexpected regression — the 4 item-mutation endpoints that had been stable and working for 3 straight rounds (v1 retest through v3) are now back to the original {\"error\":\"auth required!\"} 401 that started this whole investigation. Because of that, the actual fix Dave made (shippingmethods with a real item in the cart) could NOT be verified this round — there was no way to add an item to trigger it. One genuine improvement found: GET /carts (bare, not /carts/list) is now confirmed working across 2 rounds. No secrets embedded — fill in corenio_api_key under this collection's Variables tab before running.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
